<section class="screen-page" id="page-front">
<h1>MIDI Drum Sequencer</h1>
<p class="print-repo-url">Repository: https://github.com/thomasf/neotrellis-seq</p>
<p class="note">
  Standalone 6-voice polyphonic USB-MIDI step sequencer for the Adafruit NeoTrellis M4
  (SAMD51 Cortex-M4 at 120&thinsp;MHz, 8&times;4 RGB elastomeric keypad). Features polymetric track
  lengths, 4-level velocity dynamics, generative algorithmic transforms, and 256-step undo/redo.
</p>

