<h2>Specifications &amp; Architecture</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Feature</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Repository</td><td><a href="https://github.com/thomasf/neotrellis-seq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://github.com/thomasf/neotrellis-seq</a></td></tr>
  <tr class="no-print"><td class="k">Firmware</td><td><a href="https://github.com/thomasf/neotrellis-seq/raw/master/neotrellis-seq.uf2">neotrellis-seq.uf2</a> &mdash; prebuilt UF2 image (SAMD51 drag-and-drop flash)</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Voices</td><td>6 independent drum channels (Voice 0&ndash;5), mapped by default to General MIDI / Ableton Drum Rack (C1&ndash;D#2) on Channel 1.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Pattern Memory</td><td>16 pattern slots per voice (96 total), switchable on the fly without interrupting playback.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Track Length</td><td>Independent length per voice (1&ndash;16 steps) for evolving polymeters and phase meters.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Velocities</td><td>4 expressive levels: Accent (127), Normal (99), Ghost / Muted (50), and Rest / Silence (0).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Undo / Redo</td><td>256 edits deep across all voices. Swaps and all-voice transforms undo/redo in a single press.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Transforms</td><td>Algorithmic generators: Game of Life, Shift, Echo, Invert, Humanize, Drift, Declutter, Fill Empty.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">MIDI Transport</td><td>Class-compliant USB-MIDI following host clock (24 PPQN), start, stop, continue, and SPP.</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

