<h2>Presses</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Pad</th><th>Action</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Toggle Step</td><td>Toggles the note on step <i>n</i> of the selected pattern.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">VOICE <i>v</i></td><td class="act-name">Select Voice</td><td>Selects voice <i>v</i> for editing, and lights up while it fires.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">CLEAR</td><td class="act-name">Clear Pattern</td><td>Zeroes every step of the selected pattern.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">MENU</td><td class="act-name">Menu Mode</td><td>Enters settings menu (Voice Protect, playback path modifiers, MIDI note assignment). Press MENU again to return to sequencer.</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>Held modifiers</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Combination</th><th>Action</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">ACCENT + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Accent Step</td><td>Accents step <i>n</i> (velocity 127). Toggles an accented step back to normal velocity (99); switches a silent step on accented.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">ACCENT + CLEAR</td><td class="act-name">Clear Accents</td><td>Removes all accents from the selected pattern, leaving notes in place.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">POS + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Set Position</td><td>Moves the selected voice&rsquo;s playhead to step <i>n</i>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">POS + ALL + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Set All Position</td><td>Moves every voice&rsquo;s playhead to step <i>n</i> simultaneously.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">POS + FN1</td><td class="act-name">Rewind Transport</td><td>Resets playback position of all voices to step 0 and arms them to fire on next step/clock (can also be pressed as FN1 + POS).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">VOICE <i>v</i> + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Select Pattern</td><td>Selects pattern slot <i>n</i> for voice <i>v</i> without modifying step data. Multiple voice pads can be held at once.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">ALL + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Select All Patterns</td><td>Selects pattern slot <i>n</i> for all unprotected voices simultaneously (protected voices remain on their current slot).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN1 + &hellip;</td><td class="act-name">FN1</td><td>Accesses secondary functions: pattern transforms, presets, voice swap, and rewind (see below).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN1 + ALL + &hellip;</td><td class="act-name">FN1+ALL</td><td>Applies functions across all unprotected voices simultaneously: all-voice transforms, kit presets, odd meters, and dropout (see below).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + COPY</td><td class="act-name">Copy Pattern</td><td>Copies the selected pattern to the paste buffer.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + PASTE</td><td class="act-name">Paste Pattern</td><td>Overwrites the selected pattern with the paste buffer.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + CLEAR</td><td class="act-name">Undo</td><td>Steps back through pattern edits (256 deep). Restores to original voice and slot.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + UNDO</td><td class="act-name">Redo</td><td>Redoes the last undone edit.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + POS + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Set Length</td><td>Sets the selected pattern&rsquo;s loop length to <i>n</i> steps (temporarily moved to FN2 + the button above it).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + &hellip;</td><td class="act-name">FN2</td><td>Accesses secondary function mode 2: copy, paste, undo, redo, loop length (see below).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN2 + ALL + &hellip;</td><td class="act-name">FN2+ALL</td><td>Applies secondary functions across all voices (see below).</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">FN1 + FN2 + PASTE</td><td class="act-name">Paste All Slots</td><td>Overwrites all 16 pattern slots of the selected voice with the paste buffer (see below).</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

