<table>
  <tr><th>Pad</th><th>Action</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 1, 2</td><td class="act-name">Shift &plusmn;1</td><td>Shifts pattern left (STEP 1) or right (STEP 2) by 1 step, wrapping within length.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 3, 4</td><td class="act-name">Shift &plusmn;4</td><td>Shifts pattern left (STEP 3) or right (STEP 4) by 4 steps, wrapping within length.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 5</td><td class="act-name">Reverse</td><td>Reverses the pattern within its active length.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 6</td><td class="act-name">Invert</td><td>Inverts sounding and silent steps, keeping active pattern length.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 7</td><td class="act-name">Humanize</td><td>Randomly varies sounding step velocities between ghost, normal, and accent, adding natural groove dynamics.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 8</td><td class="act-name">Fill Empty</td><td>Adds notes on steps where no other voice sounds, prioritizing least crowded steps.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 9</td><td class="act-name">Shuffle</td><td>Randomly shuffles step order within the active pattern length.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 10</td><td class="act-name">Echo</td><td>Copies each note 2 steps later at half velocity. Repeated presses add successive echoes.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">STEP 11</td><td class="act-name">Drift</td><td>Moves one note 1 step left or right onto a free step, preserving velocity.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">ACCENT + STEP <i>n</i></td><td class="act-name">Load Preset</td><td>Loads pattern preset <i>n</i> (1&ndash;16), incorporating accents, normal hits, and ghost notes.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">POS</td><td class="act-name">Rewind</td><td>Resets playback position of all voices to step 0 and arms them to fire on next step/clock.</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">VOICE <i>v</i></td><td class="act-name">Swap Pattern</td><td>Swaps selected pattern with voice <i>v</i>&rsquo;s current pattern.</td></tr>
</table>
</section>

<section class="screen-page" id="page-fn1-all">
<h2 class="screen-title">FN1+ALL</h2>
<p class="note">
  The pad map while FN1 and ALL are both held. Applies transforms across all six
  voices simultaneously. Voices with Voice Protect enabled are shielded from
  all-voice transforms and retain their existing patterns and lengths.
  Evaluates voices in order, enabling generative interlocking variations across all drum tracks.
</p>

<div class="scroll">
<div class="grid">
  <div class="step">SHIFT &larr;1 <i>STEP 1</i></div>
  <div class="step">SHIFT &rarr;1 <i>STEP 2</i></div>
  <div class="step">SHIFT &larr;4 <i>STEP 3</i></div>
