  The pad map while holding FN2. Tapping COPY (pad 4) copies the active pattern; tapping PASTE (pad 5) pastes it.
  Below them, UNDO (pad 12) steps backwards through edits and REDO (pad 13) redoes them.
  Holding FN2 and the button above it (POS, pad 21) while tapping any step (1&ndash;16)
  sets the active pattern's loop length. With ALL held, sets loop lengths across all unprotected voices.
</p>

