<h2 class="screen-title">Menu Mode: Voice Protect &amp; Playback Paths</h2>
<p class="note">
  Press <code>MENU</code> to enter settings. Voice pads 0&ndash;5 select the settings page
  for that voice (the active voice lights in white). The top-left button (STEP 1) toggles
  <strong>Voice Protect</strong> on and off. The second step row (STEP 5&ndash;8) toggles
  4 independent, combinable <strong>Playback Path Modifiers</strong>. All toggles illuminate
  green (<code>COLOR_GREEN</code>) when active and red (<code>COLOR_RED</code>) when inactive.
  Hold any voice pad (<code>VOICE 0&ndash;5</code>) to reassign its MIDI note on the 16-step grid.
</p>

